{
  "name": "zh-json-structured-output",
  "description": "Structured-output gates over a growing conversation, prompted in zh. Uses response_format, supported on every route; structured_outputs is avoided because the Kimi route rejects it. Schema validity and field correctness are graded separately.",
  "language": "zh",
  "turns": [
    {
      "say": "帮我把一个订单录入目录。只回答 JSON：一个对象，包含键 \"order_id\"（字符串）、\"total\"（数字）和 \"items\"（对象数组，每个含 \"sku\" 和 \"quantity\"）。使用 order_id \"A-1042\"，total 128.5，两个条目：sku \"WIDGET-1\" 数量 3，sku \"BOLT-9\" 数量 7。",
      "request": {
        "response_format": {
          "type": "json_schema",
          "json_schema": {
            "name": "order",
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "order_id",
                "total",
                "items"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "order_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "total": {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                "items": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "sku",
                      "quantity"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "sku": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "quantity": {
                        "type": "integer"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "grade": {
        "kind": "json_schema",
        "value": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "order_id",
            "total",
            "items"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "order_id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "total": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "items": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "sku",
                  "quantity"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "sku": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "quantity": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "say": "把刚才那段 JSON 原样重复一遍，不要做任何改动。",
      "grade": {
        "kind": "json_field",
        "path": "items[1].sku",
        "value": "BOLT-9"
      }
    },
    {
      "say": "现在只回答 JSON：同一个对象，但 total 增加 21.5。其他字段保持完全一致。",
      "grade": {
        "kind": "json_field",
        "path": "total",
        "value": 150.0
      }
    },
    {
      "say": "只回答 JSON：一个对象，只有一个键 \"item_count\"，值为该订单中所有条目数量的总和。",
      "grade": {
        "kind": "json_field",
        "path": "item_count",
        "value": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "say": "order_id 是什么？只回答 JSON，一个含有单个键 \"order_id\" 的对象。",
      "grade": {
        "kind": "json_field",
        "path": "order_id",
        "value": "A-1042",
        "category": "recall"
      }
    }
  ]
}
